2460: @todo of marker objects, and a hand-guessed waypoint ring keeps catching on
2460: @todo internal railings and benches. (2) a machine-readable progress value
2460: @todo (explore --dump + memdiff across a driving vs parked pair, NOT a
2460: @todo single-run scan - see the crate README) to @assert on.
